==English==

===Verb===
'''to [[shoulder]] [[arms]]'''[[category:English verbs that lack inflection template]]

#{{intransitive|of a soldier, etc., at drill}} To place a [[rifle]] on the [[right]] shoulder, with the [[forearm]] [[parallel]] to the ground and the [[hand]] holding the [[butt]].
#{{intransitive|cricket}} To [[deliberately]] lift the [[bat]] out of the [[path]] of the [[ball]] when it is [[judged]] to be [[missing]] the [[wicket]].